    {
      "id": "cliions1aavhg0btcxmx7xciy",
      "name": "HTTP Caching",
      "abstract": "Whether with CDN, a reverse proxy or to avoid problems with browser caching, the basis for correct caching are the HTTP caching specifications. David Buchmann shows us how to properly use the caching headers to achieve the desired result.",
      "youtubecode": null,
      "slides": null,
      "category": "Backend",
