    {
      "id": "cmc8y6kvm9a4v07t9jwhq00px",
      "name": "Think It. Type It. Launch It. — Powered by BoostedHost Orbit",
      "abstract": "BoostedHost Orbit builds real, hosted WordPress websites in minutes—just from your idea. Fully native to Gutenberg, it understands intent and creates fast, scalable sites without templates or drag-and-drop. An AI Copilot remains built into the WordPress dashboard to guide users every step of the way, delivering the smoothest onboarding experience in web hosting.",
